  "scope": "Unchanged WeaponInterface, ComponentDefinition, InterfaceType, LevelUp, LevelUpJingles, EmoteManager, Emotes, MusicPlayer, MusicEntry, MusicZone, QuestRepository, Quest and Quests on JDK 11 with Kotlin 1.8.20 and the published ConstLib 1.4.28 (Components and Items values checked against the suffixes of the names used). Original text inserted into adapters at generation time: the EquipmentContainer slot constants, the Skills constants and SKILL_NAME, the ItemConfigParser keys, the Log constants, the Animator.Priority constants, and the ContentAPI getAttribute/setAttribute/removeAttribute/removeAttributes, setComponentVisibility, getStatLevel and sendNews functions. Everything else is a recording adapter answering from the case: packets (Interface, InterfaceConfig, String, Music, access masks), varps and varbits, attributes, equipment and item configuration, Settings attack style index and special bar, Properties attack style/animation/autocast/combat level and the combat pulse, appearance, the spell book and spell lookups, the interface manager (tabs, openTab, openChatbox, resizable), skills, news, Skillcape.trim, locks, the animator, animation durations, rights, the pulse manager, the dialogue interpreter, the Varrock diary, debug output, ticks and logging. Not driven: the SALUTE, GOBLIN_BOW and GIVE_THANKS emote overrides (content: diaries, quests, dialogue, a world pulse), Quest.start/finish/journal members, MusicPlayer.clearUnlocked and the zone registration that reaches MusicZone.",
